      <button data-view="learn"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 3H11v17H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 22Zm16 0A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 17.5 3H13v17h4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 2.5 2Z"/></svg>学习</button>
      <button data-view="review"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 3-6.7L3 8"/><path d="M3 3v5h5M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg>复习</button>
      <button data-view="dictionary"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"/><path d="m15.5 15.5 5 5"/></svg>词典</button>
      <button data-view="profile"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/></svg>我的</button>
    </nav>
    <div class="side-bottom"><div class="modebox"><div class="mode-row"><span>中文辅助模式</span><button id="helperSwitch" class="switch on" aria-label="切换中文辅助模式"><i></i></button></div><small>开启后，有帮助的词语会显示虚线。鼠标停留看拼音，点击查看完整词卡。</small></div></div>
  </aside>
  <main>
    <header class="topbar"><div class="eyebrow">HSK 3 · 第 12 周</div><div class="top-actions"><button class="iconbtn" aria-label="搜索" onclick="showView('dictionary')"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"/><path d="m15.5 15.5 5 5"/></svg></button><button class="iconbtn" aria-label="通知"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18 8a6 6 0 0 0-12 0c0 7-3 7-3 9h18c0-2-3-2-3-9ZM10 21h4"/></svg></button><div class="avatar">A</div></div></header>

    <section id="home" class="view active">
      <div class="home-head"><div><h1>下午好，Alex。</h1><p class="sub">今天也学一点中文吧。</p></div><div class="date-chip">九月二十九日 · 星期二</div></div>
      <div class="grid"><article class="card lesson-card"><span class="pill">今天的学习 · 15 分钟</span><h2><button class="word" data-word="迟到">我今天迟到了</button></h2><p class="meta">8 个词语 · 1 个语法 · 情境听说</p><button class="primary" onclick="openCurrentLesson()">继续学习</button><div class="progressline"><span></span></div></article><div style="display:grid;gap:22px"><article class="card review-card"><h3>今天需要复习 <span class="tag">17 项</span></h3><div class="review-counts"><div class="count"><b>10</b><small>词语</small></div><div class="count"><b>3</b><small>语法</small></div><div class="count"><b>4</b><small>听力</small></div></div><button class="secondary wide" onclick="showView('review')">开始复习</button></article><article class="card week-card"><h3>本周学习 <span class="sub" style="font-size:14px">4 / 7 天</span></h3><div class="week"><i class="bar done" style="--h:56%" data-d="一"></i><i class="bar done" style="--h:75%" data-d="二"></i><i class="bar done" style="--h:44%" data-d="三"></i><i class="bar done" style="--h:83%" data-d="四"></i><i class="bar" style="--h:26%" data-d="五"></i><i class="bar" style="--h:12%" data-d="六"></i><i class="bar" style="--h:12%" data-d="日"></i></div></article></div></div>
      <div class="home-path"><article class="card path-level"><b>10</b><div><strong>HSK 1 · 生存表达</strong><small>见面、时间、家庭、地点和点单</small></div></article><article class="card path-level"><b>10</b><div><strong>HSK 2 · 日常沟通</strong><small>通勤、邀请、经历、比较和原因</small></div></article><article class="card path-level"><b>10</b><div><strong>HSK 3 · 连贯表达</strong><small>计划变化、条件、结果和叙述</small></div></article></div>
    </section>

    <section id="learn" class="view">
      <div id="courseCatalog"><div class="catalog-head"><div><h1>课程路线</h1><p class="sub">30 节场景课，按 HSK 1–3 逐步建立真实交流能力。</p></div><div class="level-filters" role="group" aria-label="课程等级筛选"><button class="filter-btn active" data-level="全部" onclick="filterCourses('全部',this)">全部</button><button class="filter-btn" data-level="HSK 1" onclick="filterCourses('HSK 1',this)">HSK 1</button><button class="filter-btn" data-level="HSK 2" onclick="filterCourses('HSK 2',this)">HSK 2</button><button class="filter-btn" data-level="HSK 3" onclick="filterCourses('HSK 3',this)">HSK 3</button></div></div><div class="course-summary"><article class="card"><b>30</b><span class="sub">场景课程</span></article><article class="card"><b>6–10</b><span class="sub">每课目标词</span></article><article class="card"><b>1 / 3 / 7 / 21</b><span class="sub">初始复习日</span></article></div><div class="course-grid" id="courseGrid"></div></div>
      <div id="lessonDetail" class="hidden"><div class="lesson-back"><button class="secondary" onclick="showLessonCatalog()">返回课程路线</button><span class="sub">QH-021 · 完整示例课</span></div>
      <div class="section-head"><div><h1>我今天迟到了</h1><p class="sub">HSK 3 · 日常生活 · 预计 15 分钟</p></div><button class="secondary" onclick="speakText('我今天迟到了')">听标题</button></div>
      <div class="learn-layout"><article class="card lesson-main"><div class="stepper" id="stepper"><i class="step current"></i><i class="step"></i><i class="step"></i><i class="step"></i><i class="step"></i><i class="step"></i></div><div class="step-label"><span>情境</span><span>词汇</span><span>语法</span><span>听力</span><span>口语</span><span>完成</span></div>
        <div class="phase active" data-phase="0"><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:28px">先听一听</p><h2>早上的地铁</h2><p class="sub">先读一遍对话。点击不认识的词语，或者听每一句。</p><div class="context">
          <div class="line"><div class="speaker">林</div><div>你怎么现在才来？</div><button class="speak" onclick="speakText('你怎么现在才来？')">🔊</button></div>
          <div class="line"><div class="speaker">安</div><div>不好意思，我<button class="word" data-word="迟到">迟到</button>了。</div><button class="speak" onclick="speakText('不好意思，我迟到了。')">🔊</button></div>
          <div class="line"><div class="speaker">林</div><div>出什么事了？</div><button class="speak" onclick="speakText('出什么事了？')">🔊</button></div>
          <div class="line"><div class="speaker">安</div><div>我<button class="word" data-word="本来">本来</button>想坐<button class="word" data-word="地铁">地铁</button>，但是今天地铁的人<button class="word" data-word="特别">特别</button>多。</div><button class="speak" onclick="speakText('我本来想坐地铁，但是今天地铁的人特别多。')">🔊</button></div>
          <div class="line"><div class="speaker">林</div><div>没关系，我们也<button class="word" data-word="刚">刚</button>到。</div><button class="speak" onclick="speakText('没关系，我们也刚到。')">🔊</button></div>
        </div><div class="lesson-actions"><button class="ghost" onclick="speakText('你怎么现在才来？不好意思，我迟到了。出什么事了？我本来想坐地铁，但是今天地铁的人特别多。没关系，我们也刚到。')">播放整段</button><button class="primary" onclick="nextPhase()">学习词语</button></div></div>
        <div class="phase" data-phase="1"><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:28px">今天的词语 · 1 / 8</p><div class="vocab-display"><div class="hanzi">迟到</div><div class="pinyin">chí dào</div><p class="meaning">to be late</p><button class="iconbtn" style="margin:auto" onclick="speakText('迟到')">🔊</button></div><div class="choice-grid"><p style="text-align:center">我今天上课 ______ 了。</p><button class="choice" onclick="answerChoice(this,true)">A. 迟到</button><button class="choice" onclick="answerChoice(this,false)">B. 到迟</button><button class="choice" onclick="answerChoice(this,false)">C. 晚到</button><div class="feedback" id="vocabFeedback">很好！“迟到 + 了”表示迟到这件事已经发生。</div></div><div class="lesson-actions"><button class="ghost" onclick="prevPhase()">上一页</button><button class="primary" onclick="nextPhase()">继续学习</button></div></div>
        <div class="phase" data-phase="2"><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:28px">语法</p><h2><button class="word" data-word="本来">本来</button>……但是……</h2><p class="sub">先说原来的计划或情况，再说明后来发生的变化。</p><div class="grammar-box"><div class="pattern">本来 + 计划 / 情况，<br>但是 + 实际变化</div></div><div class="example">我<button class="word" data-word="本来">本来</button>想坐地铁，<strong>但是</strong>今天人特别多。 <button class="speak" onclick="speakText('我本来想坐地铁，但是今天人特别多。')">🔊</button></div><div class="example">我本来不想去，<strong>但是</strong>朋友请我一起去。 <button class="speak" onclick="speakText('我本来不想去，但是朋友请我一起去。')">🔊</button></div><div class="mini-practice"><label>选择最自然的回答</label><button class="choice" onclick="answerGrammar(this)">我本来想早点睡，但是晚上喝了咖啡。</button><button class="choice" onclick="answerGrammar(this)">我但是想早点睡，本来喝了咖啡。</button></div><div class="lesson-actions"><button class="ghost" onclick="prevPhase()">上一页</button><button class="primary" onclick="nextPhase()">听力练习</button></div></div>
        <div class="phase" data-phase="3"><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:28px">听音辨意</p><h2>安娜为什么迟到了？</h2><div class="audio-box"><div class="wave"><i style="--h:14px"></i><i style="--h:25px"></i><i style="--h:34px"></i><i style="--h:18px"></i><i style="--h:30px"></i><i style="--h:12px"></i><i style="--h:26px"></i></div><button class="bigplay" onclick="speakText('我本来想坐地铁，但是今天地铁的人特别多。')">▶</button><div class="sub">标准速度 · 可重复播放</div></div><div class="choice-grid"><button class="choice" onclick="answerChoice(this,false)">她起床太晚了</button><button class="choice" onclick="answerChoice(this,true)">地铁里的人很多</button><button class="choice" onclick="answerChoice(this,false)">她找不到地铁站</button></div><div class="lesson-actions"><button class="ghost" onclick="prevPhase()">上一页</button><button class="primary" onclick="nextPhase()">口语练习</button></div></div>
        <div class="phase" data-phase="4"><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:28px">跟读纠错</p><h2>先听，再说</h2><div class="audio-box"><p class="pattern" id="shadowingTarget">我本来想坐地铁，但是今天人特别多。</p><div class="record-tools"><button class="iconbtn" style="display:inline-grid" onclick="speakShadowing(.82)" aria-label="慢速听示范">🔊</button><button class="bigplay" id="recordBtn" onclick="toggleRecord()" aria-label="开始跟读" aria-pressed="false">●</button><button class="secondary" onclick="showCorrectionDemo()">查看纠错示例</button></div><p id="recordHint" class="sub">点击圆形按钮，听到提示后开始跟读</p><p class="privacy-note">本 Demo 不保存录音；语音识别是否联网由浏览器决定。</p><div class="speech-result" id="speechResult" aria-live="polite"><div class="speech-result-head"><div><strong id="speechResultTitle">本次跟读</strong><div class="sub" id="speechResultStatus">已完成识别</div></div><div class="speech-score"><b id="speechScore">--</b><small>分</small></div></div><div class="sub">识别到的内容</div><div class="speech-transcript" id="speechTranscript">正在听……</div><ul class="speech-feedback" id="speechFeedback"></ul><div class="speech-actions"><button class="secondary" onclick="resetCorrection()">重新跟读</button><button class="ghost" onclick="speakShadowing(.72)">慢速再听</button></div></div></div><div class="grammar-box"><strong>说话提示</strong><br>注意“本来”和“但是”后面的短暂停顿。语速不需要太快。</div><div class="lesson-actions"><button class="ghost" onclick="prevPhase()">上一页</button><button class="primary" onclick="nextPhase()">完成课程</button></div></div>
        <div class="phase" data-phase="5"><div class="complete"><div class="complete-mark">✓</div><p class="eyebrow">课程完成</p><h2>今天学得很好</h2><p class="sub">你完成了《我今天迟到了》，新内容会按照记忆节奏安排复习。</p><div class="score-row"><div class="score"><b>8</b><small>新词语</small></div><div class="score"><b>1</b><small>语法点</small></div><div class="score"><b>12 分</b><small>学习时间</small></div></div><button class="primary" onclick="showView('review')">去看看复习安排</button> <button class="secondary" onclick="restartLesson()">再学一次</button></div></div>
      </article><aside class="card outline-card"><h3>本课内容</h3><div class="outline-list" id="outline"><div class="outline-item now">情境对话 <span>现在</span></div><div class="outline-item">8 个词语 <span>约 4 分</span></div><div class="outline-item">本来……但是…… <span>约 3 分</span></div><div class="outline-item">听音辨意 <span>约 2 分</span></div><div class="outline-item">跟读口语 <span>约 2 分</span></div><div class="outline-item">完成 <span>总结</span></div></div><div class="grammar-box" style="margin-top:26px"><small class="sub">学习小提示</small><br>在课文里理解词语，比单独背词更容易记住。</div></aside></div></div>
    </section>

    <section id="review" class="view"><div class="section-head"><div><h1>今天的复习</h1><p class="sub">词义、听音、填空和表达会混合出现。</p></div><span class="pill">17 项 · 预计 9 分钟</span></div><div class="review-layout"><article class="card review-hero"><div class="review-top"><div><p class="eyebrow">间隔重复</p><h2>先回忆，再看答案</h2><p class="sub">答得困难会提前再出现；熟悉的内容会逐步延后。</p></div><div class="ring"></div></div><div class="review-types"><div class="review-type">字 <b>词义辨认</b><small>中文与英文</small></div><div class="review-type">♪ <b>听音辨词</b><small>标准普通话</small></div><div class="review-type">＿ <b>句中填空</b><small>恢复语境</small></div><div class="review-type">✎ <b>主动表达</b><small>使用目标结构</small></div></div><button class="primary" id="startReviewBtn" onclick="startReview()">开始混合复习</button><div id="reviewDemo" class="review-workspace"><div class="eyebrow" id="reviewTypeLabel">词义辨认</div><div class="review-progress"><span id="reviewProgressBar" style="width:25%"></span></div><div class="review-prompt" id="reviewQuestion"></div><div id="reviewMedia"></div><div id="reviewOptions"></div><input id="reviewInput" class="review-answer-input hidden" placeholder="输入你的答案" aria-label="复习答案"><button id="reviewCheckBtn" class="primary hidden" onclick="checkReviewInput()">检查答案</button><div id="reviewFeedback" class="review-feedback"></div><div id="reviewGrades" class="review-grades"><button class="secondary" onclick="gradeReview('hard')">困难 · 明天</button><button class="secondary" onclick="gradeReview('good')">还好 · 3 天</button><button class="secondary" onclick="gradeReview('easy')">熟悉 · 7 天</button></div></div></article><aside class="card"><h3>记忆节奏</h3><p class="sub">初始安排来自课程规划，随后根据每次回答调整。</p><div class="timeline"><div class="timepoint"><i></i>学习</div><div class="timepoint"><i></i>1 天</div><div class="timepoint"><i></i>3 天</div><div class="timepoint"><i></i>7 天</div><div class="timepoint"><i></i>21 天</div></div><div class="schedule-list"><div class="schedule-row"><span>本来</span><strong>今天</strong></div><div class="schedule-row"><span>迟到</span><strong>明天</strong></div><div class="schedule-row"><span>特别</span><strong>3 天后</strong></div><div class="schedule-row"><span>本来……但是……</span><strong>7 天后</strong></div></div><div class="grammar-box"><strong>无需一次全记住。</strong><br><span class="sub">复习时间由记忆表现决定，不只按固定日期重复。</span></div></aside></div></section>

    <section id="dictionary" class="view"><div><h1>学习词典</h1><p class="sub">查词、听发音、看搭配、例句和 HSK 位置。</p></div><div class="dict-search"><input id="dictInput" value="本来" placeholder="输入汉字或拼音，例如：本来 / ben lai" aria-label="词典搜索"><button class="primary" onclick="searchDict()">查找</button></div><div class="dict-suggestions"><button onclick="lookupWord('迟到')">迟到</button><button onclick="lookupWord('本来')">本来</button><button onclick="lookupWord('地铁')">地铁</button><button onclick="lookupWord('终于')">终于</button><button onclick="lookupWord('快递')">快递</button><button onclick="lookupWord('护照')">护照</button></div><div class="dict-entry"><article class="card"><div class="entry-head"><div><div class="entry-word" id="dictWord">本来</div><div class="entry-pinyin" id="dictPinyin">běn lái</div></div><button class="iconbtn" onclick="speakText(document.getElementById('dictWord').textContent)" aria-label="播放词语发音">🔊</button></div><div><span class="pill" id="dictLevel">HSK 3 · 副词</span></div><div class="dict-meta-grid"><div class="dict-meta"><small>繁体</small><strong id="dictTraditional">本來</strong></div><div class="dict-meta"><small>词性</small><strong id="dictPos">副词</strong></div></div><div class="sense"><h3 id="dictMeaning">originally; at first</h3><p id="dictExplain">表示原来的情况、想法或计划，后来可能发生了变化。</p></div><h3>常见搭配</h3><div class="saved-words" id="dictCollocations"><span>本来想</span><span>本来就</span><span>本来以为</span></div><h3 style="margin-top:24px">例句</h3><div id="dictExamples"><div class="example">我本来想坐地铁，但是今天人特别多。 <button class="speak" onclick="speakText('我本来想坐地铁，但是今天人特别多。')">🔊</button></div><div class="example">这件事本来很简单。 <button class="speak" onclick="speakText('这件事本来很简单。')">🔊</button></div></div><p class="source-note" id="dictSource">示例词条 · 自建释义与例句 · 正式版将记录词典版本与授权来源</p></article><aside style="display:grid;gap:22px"><div class="card compare"><h3>容易混淆</h3><p><strong>本来</strong>：原来的情况或计划</p><p><strong>原来</strong>：后来发现真实情况</p><div class="example">原来你也住在这儿！</div></div><div class="card"><h3>最近查过</h3><div class="saved-words" id="recentWords"><span class="recent-word" onclick="lookupWord('迟到')">迟到</span><span class="recent-word" onclick="lookupWord('特别')">特别</span><span class="recent-word" onclick="lookupWord('地铁')">地铁</span><span class="recent-word" onclick="lookupWord('刚')">刚</span></div></div><div class="card"><h3>数据说明</h3><p class="sub">当前 Demo 使用自建示例词条。正式词库计划结合 CC-CEDICT、Unicode Unihan 与人工多音字审校，并提供来源与许可页面。</p></div></aside></div></section>

    <section id="profile" class="view"><div class="section-head"><div><h1>我的学习</h1><p class="sub">Alex · 现在学习 HSK 3</p></div></div><div class="profile-grid"><article class="card profile-top"><div class="large-avatar">A</div><div><h2 style="margin-bottom:4px">Alex</h2><span class="pill">连续学习 12 天</span></div></article><article class="card"><h3>本月进度</h3><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><b>186</b><small>已学词语</small></div><div class="stat"><b>14</b><small>完成课程</small></div><div class="stat"><b>4.6h</b><small>学习时间</small></div></div><div class="progressline"><span style="width:62%"></span></div><p class="sub" style="margin-top:10px">HSK 3 课程完成 62%</p></article><article class="card"><h3>学习设置</h3><div class="settings"><div class="setting"><span>中文辅助模式</span><button class="switch on mirrorSwitch" onclick="toggleHelper()"><i></i></button></div><div class="setting"><span>拼音显示</span><span class="tag">悬停 / 点击</span></div><div class="setting"><span>发音速度</span><span class="tag">标准 1.0×</span></div><div class="setting"><span>每日目标</span><span class="tag">15 分钟</span></div></div></article><article class="card theme-card"><h3>界面配色</h3><p class="sub">四套低饱和主题，选择会保存在当前设备。</p><div class="theme-options"><button class="theme-option active" data-theme-option="qinghe" onclick="setTheme('qinghe')"><span class="theme-swatches"><i style="background:#f7f3e7"></i><i style="background:#dfe7d6"></i><i style="background:#60735a"></i></span><strong>青禾米绿</strong><small>温暖、自然，当前默认</small></button><button class="theme-option" data-theme-option="mist" onclick="setTheme('mist')"><span class="theme-swatches"><i style="background:#f3f1e8"></i><i style="background:#dce7eb"></i><i style="background:#526c7a"></i></span><strong>雾蓝杏仁</strong><small>清爽、安静，适合长时间阅读</small></button><button class="theme-option" data-theme-option="tea" onclick="setTheme('tea')"><span class="theme-swatches"><i style="background:#f4efe6"></i><i style="background:#e7ddd0"></i><i style="background:#765f4c"></i></span><strong>茶棕月白</strong><small>柔和、稳重，纸张感更强</small></button><button class="theme-option" data-theme-option="wisteria" onclick="setTheme('wisteria')"><span class="theme-swatches"><i style="background:#f3f1f0"></i><i style="background:#e3e1ea"></i><i style="background:#665f78"></i></span><strong>紫藤岩灰</strong><small>克制、现代，对比柔和</small></button></div></article><article class="card content-standard"><h3>内容体系</h3><p class="sub">课程、词典、语音和复习按同一套字段与审校流程组织。</p><div class="standard-grid"><div class="standard-item"><b>30</b><small>HSK 1–3 场景课</small></div><div class="standard-item"><b>13</b><small>单课内容步骤</small></div><div class="standard-item"><b>4</b><small>混合复习类型</small></div><div class="standard-item"><b>2</b><small>标准与慢速语音</small></div></div><p class="source-note">正式发布前需要完成 HSK 最新大纲校准、母语教师审校、普通话审核，以及词典和音频的版本与许可记录。</p></article></div></section>
  </main>
</div>

<div class="pinyin-tip" id="pinyinTip" role="tooltip" aria-hidden="true"><strong id="tipWord"></strong><span id="tipPinyin"></span></div>
<div class="modal-wrap" id="wordModal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modalWord"><div class="modal"><button class="close" onclick="closeModal()" aria-label="关闭">×</button><div class="modal-word" id="modalWord">本来</div><div class="modal-pinyin" id="modalPinyin">běn lái</div><div class="modal-meaning" id="modalMeaning">originally; at first</div><span class="pill" id="modalLevel">HSK 3</span><div class="example" id="modalExample" style="margin-top:18px">我本来想坐地铁。</div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:18px"><button class="secondary" id="modalSpeak">听发音</button><button class="primary" onclick="saveWord()">加入生词本</button></div></div></div><div class="toast" id="toast">已加入生词本</div>
<div class="modal-wrap" id="courseModal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="courseModalTitle"><div class="modal" style="width:min(620px,100%)"><button class="close" onclick="closeCourseModal()" aria-label="关闭">×</button><span class="pill" id="courseModalLevel">HSK 3</span><h2 id="courseModalTitle" style="margin:15px 0 5px">我今天迟到了</h2><p class="sub" id="courseModalScene">上课迟到</p><div class="course-modal-grid"><div class="course-modal-item"><small>核心语法 / 功能</small><strong id="courseModalGrammar"></strong></div><div class="course-modal-item"><small>词汇主题</small><strong id="courseModalVocab"></strong></div><div class="course-modal-item"><small>听力任务</small><strong id="courseModalListening"></strong></div><div class="course-modal-item"><small>口语输出</small><strong id="courseModalSpeaking"></strong></div></div><div class="example"><strong>复习重点：</strong><span id="courseModalReview"></span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:18px"><button class="secondary" onclick="closeCourseModal()">返回目录</button><button class="primary" id="courseModalAction">进入课程</button></div></div></div>
